  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-blue'><div class='task-block-label'>Info: Wertetabelle → Graph</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 8px 0;'>Jede Zeile der Wertetabelle ergibt einen <strong>Punkt</strong> im Koordinatensystem: x ist die waagerechte Position, f(x) die Höhe. Trage alle Punkte als Kreise ein und verbinde sie zum Graphen.</p><div style='background:#eff6ff;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:13px;'>Tabellenpunkt (x | f(x)) → Punkt im KS &nbsp;&nbsp; Beispiel: (0 | 2) → Kreuz bei x=0, y=2</div></div><svg viewBox='0 0 295 135' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-width:350px;display:block;margin:8px auto 12px;'><defs><marker id='ax11' markerWidth='6' markerHeight='5' refX='5' refY='2.5' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L0,5 L6,2.5 z' fill='#555'/></marker></defs><text x='46' y='10' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#555' font-weight='600'>Wertetabelle</text><rect x='4' y='14' width='84' height='115' rx='5' fill='white' stroke='#d1d5db' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='4' y='14' width='84' height='22' rx='5' fill='#1C1B1F'/><rect x='4' y='26' width='84' height='10' fill='#1C1B1F'/><line x1='46' y1='14' x2='46' y2='129' stroke='#d1d5db' stroke-width='0.8'/><text x='25' y='29' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#fbbf24' font-weight='700'>x</text><text x='67' y='29' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#93c5fd' font-weight='700'>f(x)</text><line x1='4' y1='36' x2='88' y2='36' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='4' y1='66' x2='88' y2='66' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><line x1='4' y1='96' x2='88' y2='96' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.6'/><text x='25' y='55' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#bbb'>−1</text><text x='67' y='55' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#bbb'>0</text><rect x='4' y='66' width='84' height='30' fill='#fffbeb'/><text x='25' y='85' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13' fill='#d97706' font-weight='700'>1</text><text x='67' y='85' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700'>4</text><text x='25' y='115' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#bbb'>3</text><text x='67' y='115' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#bbb'>8</text><text x='106' y='77' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' fill='#777'>→</text><text x='230' y='10' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#555' font-weight='600'>Koordinatensystem</text><line x1='158' y1='89' x2='258' y2='89' stroke='#eee' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='158' y1='76' x2='258' y2='76' stroke='#eee' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='158' y1='63' x2='258' y2='63' stroke='#eee' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='158' y1='50' x2='258' y2='50' stroke='#eee' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='158' y1='115' x2='258' y2='115' stroke='#eee' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='177' y1='14' x2='177' y2='128' stroke='#eee' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='203' y1='14' x2='203' y2='128' stroke='#eee' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='216' y1='14' x2='216' y2='128' stroke='#eee' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='229' y1='14' x2='229' y2='128' stroke='#eee' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='153' y1='102' x2='258' y2='102' stroke='#555' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ax11)'/><line x1='190' y1='130' x2='190' y2='10' stroke='#555' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ax11)'/><text x='261' y='106' font-size='9' fill='#555'>x</text><text x='194' y='7' font-size='9' fill='#555'>y</text><text x='177' y='114' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#bbb'>−1</text><text x='203' y='114' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#d97706' font-weight='700'>1</text><text x='216' y='114' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#aaa'>2</text><text x='229' y='114' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#aaa'>3</text><text x='186' y='92' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#aaa'>1</text><text x='186' y='79' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#aaa'>2</text><text x='186' y='66' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#aaa'>3</text><text x='186' y='53' text-anchor='end' font-size='10' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700'>4</text><line x1='203' y1='102' x2='203' y2='50' stroke='#d97706' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='3,2'/><line x1='190' y1='50' x2='203' y2='50' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='3,2'/><circle cx='203' cy='50' r='5' fill='#dc2626' stroke='white' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='210' y='45' font-size='10' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>(1|4)</text></svg><p style='font-size:14px;margin:14px 0 6px 0;'><strong>a)</strong> Gegeben ist die Wertetabelle einer Funktion f. Zeichne den Graphen auf Papier.</p><div class='tbl-wrap'><table><thead><tr><th style='background:#1C1B1F;'>x</th><th style='background:#1C1B1F;'>&minus;3</th><th style='background:#1C1B1F;'>&minus;2</th><th style='background:#1C1B1F;'>&minus;1</th><th style='background:#1C1B1F;'>0</th><th style='background:#1C1B1F;'>1</th><th style='background:#1C1B1F;'>2</th><th style='background:#1C1B1F;'>3</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='row-label'>f(x)</td><td style='text-align:center;font-size:13px;'>&minus;4</td><td style='text-align:center;font-size:13px;'>&minus;2</td><td style='text-align:center;font-size:13px;'>0</td><td style='text-align:center;font-size:13px;'>2</td><td style='text-align:center;font-size:13px;'>4</td><td style='text-align:center;font-size:13px;'>6</td><td style='text-align:center;font-size:13px;'>8</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style='background:#f0fdf4;border:1.5px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:10px 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;'><strong>So gehst du vor:</strong><ol style='margin:4px 0 0 0;padding-left:18px;'><li>Koordinatensystem: x-Achse von &minus;4 bis 5, y-Achse von &minus;6 bis 10.</li><li>Alle 7 Punkte aus der Tabelle als Kreuze einzeichnen.</li><li>Mit dem Lineal verbinden – und die Linie verlängern.</li></ol></div><p style='font-size:14px;margin:10px 0 6px 0;'><strong>b)</strong> Verlängere deinen Graphen und lies ab:</p><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:4px;'><span style='font-size:14px;'>f(5) = <input class='cell-input' data-ans='12' placeholder='?' style='width:56px;font-size:13px;padding:4px 6px;border-radius:6px;border:1.5px solid #e5e5e5;text-align:center;'></span><span style='font-size:14px;'>f(&minus;5) = <input class='cell-input' data-ans='-8' placeholder='?' style='width:56px;font-size:13px;padding:4px 6px;border-radius:6px;border:1.5px solid #e5e5e5;text-align:center;'></span></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(11)'>&#x2713; Überprüfen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(11)'>&#x21BA; Zurücksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-11'></span></div>",
  "sol_html": "<p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px 0;'>Dein Graph ist eine <strong>gerade Linie</strong>, die von links unten nach rechts oben verläuft und alle 7 Tabellenpunkte trifft.</p><svg viewBox='0 0 226 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-width:280px;display:block;margin:10px auto 12px;'><defs><marker id='ax11s' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='6' refX='6' refY='3' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L0,6 L7,3 z' fill='#555'/></marker></defs><line x1='16' y1='10' x2='16' y2='248' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='34' y1='10' x2='34' y2='248' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='52' y1='10' x2='52' y2='248' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='70' y1='10' x2='70' y2='248' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='106' y1='10' x2='106' y2='248' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='124' y1='10' x2='124' y2='248' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='142' y1='10' x2='142' y2='248' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='160' y1='10' x2='160' y2='248' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='178' y1='10' x2='178' y2='248' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='244' x2='190' y2='244' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='230' x2='190' y2='230' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='216' x2='190' y2='216' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='202' x2='190' y2='202' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='188' x2='190' y2='188' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='174' x2='190' y2='174' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='146' x2='190' y2='146' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='132' x2='190' y2='132' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='118' x2='190' y2='118' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='104' x2='190' y2='104' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='8' y1='90' x2='190' y2='90' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-